Why I think these two documents are important

With these in place, you'll have a clean governance separation:

Document	Governs
UI-EP-001	How BTA looks (presentation)
UX-EP-001	How BTA behaves (interaction)
CG-EP-001	Constitutional governance
ADR-001	Architectural decisions
DF-EP-xxx	Data and persistence
TI-EP-xxx	Technical implementation

This creates a layered governance model where architecture, implementation, presentation, and interaction each have clearly defined responsibilities. I think it will make future design and development discussions much more precise because contributors will know exactly which document governs a particular decision.
